    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/b2f6a400cda4ca9e373f7d04b751c5b6.avif?t=1754307139\" data-has-big width=1600 height=516 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an expansive dungeon riddled with skeletons! Discover over 100 levels and find exciting secrets and skillful challenges! Fight for a high score in this marathon style arcade game. Do you have what it takes to claim the throne of the skeleton king?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/fb0e66407af828ed25059dc062a210d8.avif?t=1754307139\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <i>100</i> Expansive Levels to get lost in!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/26911e9923ecbf39d7124b9d119e9b8b.poster.avif?t=1754307139\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/26911e9923ecbf39d7124b9d119e9b8b.webm?t=1754307139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/26911e9923ecbf39d7124b9d119e9b8b.mp4?t=1754307139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 <strong>Epic</strong> bosses to conquer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/4a367bd1760a02ef8686705caa431e07.poster.avif?t=1754307139\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/4a367bd1760a02ef8686705caa431e07.webm?t=1754307139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/4a367bd1760a02ef8686705caa431e07.mp4?t=1754307139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 <u>Challenging</u> enemies to defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill based combat system to <strong>master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882570/extras/e61abd6ebb4aefed597c166588c4cec4.avif?t=1754307139\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil king ruling this dungeon has overstayed his welcome! You must delve deep into the earth to find his court and slay him once in for all. You will encounter magical secrets and evil bone soldiers along the way. By sitting on his throne, you will become a new skeleton king and usher forth a new age of skeleton glory!</p>",
